review: yearly
effective: 2026-10-10
review-by: 2027-10-10
---

A company laptop holds source code, credentials, and sometimes customer data. These rules keep that safe if the laptop leaves your hands.

@note {type=policy}
Every laptop has an encrypted disk and a screen that locks after five minutes. Report a lost laptop within an hour.

## Disk encryption
@id: disk-encryption

The disk of every laptop is encrypted. Don't turn encryption off, even for a short time.

## Screen lock
@id: screen-lock

The screen locks after five minutes without use, and needs your password to unlock. Lock it yourself whenever you step away.

## If a laptop is lost
@id: if-a-laptop-is-lost

Report a lost or stolen laptop within an hour of noticing it's gone, at any time of day.

@include: ../_fragments/report.md

